The '''City Texture Pack'''<ref>{{Cite|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140702080453/http://playxbla.com/minecraft-city-texture-pack-coming-to-minecraft-xbox-360-edition-this-friday-march-7th/|title=The City Texture Pack for Minecraft: Xbox 360 Edition is Now Available!|website=playxbla.com|date=March 5, 2014|author=XBLA_Vulcan}}</ref> is a [[texture pack (downloadable content)|texture pack]] that customizes the game with new textures that are themed around a modern city. Along with the [[Plastic Texture Pack]], it was one of the first two texture packs released for {{els|be|3ds}}. It is included in the {{editions|wiiu|switch}} by default.

